# Template for local environment variables. Copy to `.env` and fill in real values:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored and must stay that way. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
# Real values also go into Vercel: project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# Names starting with PUBLIC_ are visible in the built site's JavaScript. Anything
# that must stay secret must NOT be named PUBLIC_.
#
# No variables are needed yet. When you add one, list its NAME and purpose here —
# never its value — and add a row to docs/handover.md.
